B.aFQ=new A.lQ("architect","Nova","App Architect","Plans screens, flows, and features for your app.",B.ahf,B.cE,"You are Nova, an app architect inside NGMY App Builder. Design clear screen flows. Reply with practical structure: app name, tagline, screen list (welcome/menu/content/form/aiChat), and navigation.")
B.Jf=new A.L(983105,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aFS=new A.lQ("designer","Luna","UI Designer","Writes headlines, colors, and polished copy.",B.Jf,B.aN,"You are Luna, a UI designer for NGMY mini-apps. Improve titles, subtitles, button labels, and theme colors. Keep copy short, friendly, and mobile-first.")
B.aFR=new A.lQ("builder","Bolt","AI App Copilot","Talk to Bolt \u2014 command changes and build screens for you.",B.zc,B.aI,'You are Bolt \u2014 the most capable NGMY App Studio AI. Build ANY app users dream of: social, media feeds, business, fitness, e-commerce, school, church, games, portfolios, booking, CRM, dashboards, invoices, QR, or custom code. You write full working JSON layouts AND can put raw code ideas in customCode. Users may also edit Code Studio themselves. Never refuse \u2014 always deliver ---APP_JSON--- when they want changes. Forms save data, lists show data, switches work, dark_mode toggles theme. Keep stable screen ids when editing. Understand intent: "add a button that..." means create button widget + target screen + wire navigation. "Build a store" means checkout, cart, add product form, product list \u2014 full app not one screen. "QR code app" means qrGenerator (url+text screens) + saved list. "Invoice app" means invoiceBuilder + invoice list. "Video/download app" means form saving URLs + dataList with urlField. "TikTok/reels" means reelFeed home + postComposer + shell.bottomNav \u2014 NEVER hero+menuGrid. "Facebook" means socialFeed + postComposer. "Google search" means searchHub. ALWAYS output ---APP_JSON---.')
B.aFT=new A.lQ("reviewer","Sage","App Reviewer","Checks clarity, missing pieces, and publish readiness.",B.IT,B.ap,"You are Sage, a reviewer for NGMY apps. Audit completeness: naming, navigation, empty fields, UX issues. Give a publish readiness score 0-100 and bullet fixes.")
B.oR=s([B.aFQ,B.aFS,B.aFR,B.aFT],A.br("ac<lQ>"))
B.ask=s(["Meet for iced coffee at a cozy corner caf\xe9 \u2014 keep the first chat light and warm.","Grab matcha lattes and take a slow walk through a pretty downtown street.","Share a fruit smoothie at a sunny outdoor patio and people-watch together.","Try a dessert caf\xe9 \u2014 split a slice of cake and talk about favorite memories.","Meet for hot chocolate on a cool evening; bring a light jacket for them if it is chilly.","Visit a bookstore caf\xe9, pick a book each, and swap why you chose it.","Get bubble tea with two straws and play \u201cthis or that\u201d questions.","Meet at a farmers market, sample something small, and stroll the stalls.","Share artisan pizza at a small Italian spot \u2014 split a margherita and a salad.","Try tacos from a popular local truck, then sit in a park nearby.","Breakfast date: pancakes, fresh juice, and no rush to leave the table.","Sushi lunch at a calm spot \u2014 order a few rolls to share and one surprise roll.","Meet for fresh lemonade and sandwiches at a riverside bench.","Visit a tea house for jasmine tea and quiet conversation.","Grab gelato and walk through a garden or campus green.","Try a food hall: each pick one dish and taste from both plates.","Meet for soup and bread at a homestyle diner \u2014 comfort food builds comfort.","Share a charcuterie board and sparkling water at a wine-free bistro patio.","Visit a donut shop early and bring one extra for \u201clater.\u201d","Meet for acai bowls and talk about dreams, not just schedules.","Try a juice bar smoothie bowl after a short morning hike together.","Meet at a rooftop caf\xe9 at golden hour \u2014 photos optional, presence required.","Share pasta at a candle-free lunch spot; save candles for another time.","Visit a bakery, choose two pastries, and rank them honestly.","Meet for chai and samosas at a cozy Indian caf\xe9.","Try Korean street snacks at a small shop and share everything.","Meet for fresh spring rolls and iced tea \u2014 light, fresh, easy to talk.","Share fish and chips by the water if you live near a coast or lake.","Visit a plant-based caf\xe9 even if you are not vegan \u2014 curiosity is attractive.","Meet for espresso and cannoli \u2014 short, sweet, memorable.","Try a build-your-own bowl place; compare creations like a fun contest.","Meet at a dog-friendly patio if one of you has a calm pet \u2014 instant icebreaker.","Share crepes \u2014 one savory, one sweet \u2014 at a French-style caf\xe9.","Visit a chocolate shop for truffles and a five-minute tasting ritual.","Meet for pho or ramen; warm bowls make honest conversation easier.","Try a Mediterranean platter with hummus, pita, and grilled vegetables.","Meet for iced hibiscus tea and a shared salad on a shaded terrace.","Visit a comic shop with a caf\xe9 inside \u2014 laugh together early.","Share wings or sliders at a sports bar during an early, quiet hour.","Meet for cronuts or fresh croissants and talk about childhood favorites.","Try a pop-up food event \u2014 exploring something new together bonds fast.","Meet for coconut water and tropical fruit after a beach walk.","Share a cheese toastie and tomato soup on a rainy afternoon.","Visit a flower market and buy one stem each for the other.","Meet for lavender latte and shortbread at a calm neighborhood spot.","Try handmade pasta at a chef-owned trattoria \u2014 dress cute but casual.","Meet for boba and board games at a caf\xe9 that hosts game nights.","Share a picnic basket you prepared: sandwiches, grapes, and a kind note.","Visit a sunset viewpoint with thermoses of cider or sparkling juice.","End the first meet with a clear \u201cI enjoyed today\u201d \u2014 confidence is romantic."],t.s)
